{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "granthId": "dasam",
  "ang": 636,
  "lineCount": 48,
  "source": "BaniDB",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0001",
      "lineIndex": 1,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਰੁ ਬਿਸਨ ਨਿਜ ਤੇਜ ਕਾਢਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "brahamaa r bisan nij tej kaadd ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਅਤੇ ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਨੇ ਵੀ ਆਪਣਾ ਤੇਜ ਕਢ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ब्रहमा रु बिसन निज तेज काढि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101987",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0002",
      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਏ ਸੁ ਮਧਿ ਅਨਿਸੂਆ ਛਾਡਿ ॥੧੩॥",
      "transliteration": "aae su madh anisooaa chhaadd ||13||",
      "translation": "On returning, he married Ansuya, who had been blessed by Shiva, Brahma and Vishnu by their Lustre.13.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਨਸੂਆ (ਦੇ ਸ਼ਰੀਰ) ਵਿਚ ਆ ਕੇ ਛਡ ਦਿੱਤਾ ॥੧੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आए सु मधि अनिसूआ छाडि ॥१३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101988",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਭਈ ਕਰਤ ਜੋਗ ਬਹੁ ਦਿਨ ਪ੍ਰਮਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bhiee karat jog bahu dhin pramaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਹੁਤ ਦਿਨਾ ਤਕ (ਅਨਸੂਆ) ਯੋਗ ਕਰਦੀ ਰਹੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भई करत जोग बहु दिन प्रमान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101989",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0004",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਨਸੂਆ ਨਾਮ ਗੁਨ ਗਨ ਮਹਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "anasooaa naam gun gan mahaan ||",
      "translation": "Ansuya also, in consonance with her name, inspection being a charming lady, performed austerities",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਨਸੂਆ ਨਾ ਵਾਲੀ (ਉਹ ਇਸਤਰੀ) ਗੁਣਾ ਦਾ ਸਮੂਹ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अनसूआ नाम गुन गन महान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101990",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0005",
      "lineIndex": 5,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਤਿ ਤੇਜਵੰਤ ਸੋਭਾ ਸੁਰੰਗ ॥",
      "transliteration": "at tejava(n)t sobhaa sura(n)g ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਹ) ਬਹੁਤ ਤੇਜਸਵੀ ਅਤੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਰੰਗ ਅਤੇ ਸ਼ੋਭਾ ਵਾਲੀ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अति तेजवंत सोभा सुरंग ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101991",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0006",
      "lineIndex": 6,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਨੁ ਧਰਾ ਰੂਪ ਦੂਸਰ ਅਨੰਗ ॥੧੪॥",
      "transliteration": "jan dharaa roop dhoosar ana(n)g ||14||",
      "translation": "She was extremely lustrous and glorious and it appeared that she was the second manifestation of the goddess of love (Rati).14.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਾਨੋ ਕਾਮਦੇਵ ਨੇ ਦੂਜਾ ਰੂਪ ਧਾਰਨ ਕੀਤਾ ਹੋਇਆ ਹੋਵੇ ॥੧੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जनु धरा रूप दूसर अनंग ॥१४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101992",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0007",
      "lineIndex": 7,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸੋਭਾ ਅਪਾਰ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਅਨੰਤ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sobhaa apaar su(n)dhar ana(n)t ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੀ) ਅਪਾਰ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸ਼ੋਭਾ ਜਾਣੀ ਜਾਦੀ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सोभा अपार सुँदर अनंत ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101993",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0008",
      "lineIndex": 8,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਊਹਾਗ ਭਾਗ ਬਹੁ ਬਿਧਿ ਲਸੰਤ ॥",
      "transliteration": "suoohaag bhaag bahu bidh lasa(n)t ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦਾ) ਸੁਹਾਗ ਭਾਗ ਬਹੁਤ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਨਾਲ ਚਮਕਦਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सऊहाग भाग बहु बिधि लसंत ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101994",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0009",
      "lineIndex": 9,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਿਹ ਨਿਰਖਿ ਰੂਪ ਸੋਰਹਿ ਲੁਭਾਇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jeh nirakh roop soreh lubhai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਰੂਪ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਸੋਲ੍ਰਹਾ (ਕਲਾਵਾ) ਵਾਲੇ ਲੋਭਾਇਮਾਨ ਰਹਿੰਦੇ ਸਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जिह निरखि रूप सोरहि लुभाइ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101995",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0010",
      "lineIndex": 10,
      "gurmukhi": "ਆਭਾ ਅਪਾਰ ਬਰਨੀ ਨ ਜਾਇ ॥੧੫॥",
      "transliteration": "aabhaa apaar baranee na jai ||15||",
      "translation": "That pretty and married fortunate woman was glorious in various ways on seeing whom, the personification of beauty also got allured her glory is indescribable.15.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੀ) ਅਪਾਰ ਸ਼ੋਭਾ ਦਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਨਹੀਂ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾ ਸਕਦਾ ॥੧੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "आभा अपार बरनी न जाइ ॥१५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101996",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0011",
      "lineIndex": 11,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਿਸ ਨਾਥ ਦੇਖਿ ਆਨਨ ਰਿਸਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nis naath dhekh aanan risaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੇ) ਮੁਖ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ ਗੁੱਸਾ ਕਰਦਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "निस नाथ देखि आनन रिसान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101997",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0012",
      "lineIndex": 12,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਲਿ ਜਾਇ ਨੈਨ ਲਹਿ ਰੋਸ ਮਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jal jai nain leh ros maan ||",
      "translation": "Seeing her face, the moon was filled with jealousy and wept in affection",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੱਖਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਕਮਲ ('ਜਲ ਜਾਇ') ਕ੍ਰੋਧ ਮਨਾਉਾਂਦਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जलि जाइ नैन लहि रोस मान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101998",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0013",
      "lineIndex": 13,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਮ ਨਿਰਖਿ ਕੇਸ ਕੀਅ ਨੀਚ ਡੀਠ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tam nirakh kes keea neech ddeeTh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੰਧਕਾਰ (ਉਸ ਦੇ) ਕੇਸਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਨੀਵੀਂ ਪਾ ਲੈਂਦਾ ਸੀ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तम निरखि केस कीअ नीच डीठ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "101999",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਛਪਿ ਰਹਾ ਜਾਨੁ ਗਿਰ ਹੇਮ ਪੀਠ ॥੧੬॥",
      "transliteration": "chhap rahaa jaan gir hem peeTh ||16||",
      "translation": "Seeing her hair, he bowed down her looks and even the Sumeru mountain, seeing her beauty, concealed himself.16.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੀ) ਪਿਠ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਸੁਮੇਰ ਪਰਬਤ ਲੁਕ ਰਿਹਾ ਸੀ ॥੧੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "छपि रहा जानु गिर हेम पीठ ॥१६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102000",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕੰਠਹਿ ਕਪੋਤਿ ਲਖਿ ਕੋਪ ਕੀਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ka(n)Theh kapot lakh kop keen ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੀ) ਗਰਦਨ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਕਬੂਤਰ ਨੇ ਰੋਸ ਕੀਤਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कंठहि कपोति लखि कोप कीन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102001",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਸਾ ਨਿਹਾਰਿ ਬਨਿ ਕੀਰ ਲੀਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "naasaa nihaar ban keer leen ||",
      "translation": "Seeing her neck, the female pigeon got enraged and the parrot seeing her nostril hid himself in the forest",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਨਕ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਤੋਤੇ ਨੇ ਬਨ ਦਾ ਰਾਹ ਫੜਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नासा निहारि बनि कीर लीन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102002",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰੋਮਾਵਲਿ ਹੇਰਿ ਜਮੁਨਾ ਰਿਸਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "romaaval her jamunaa risaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੀ) ਰੋਮਾਵਲੀ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਜਮਨਾ ਕ੍ਰੋਧਿਤ ਹੋ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रोमावलि हेरि जमुना रिसान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102003",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਲਜਾ ਮਰੰਤ ਸਾਗਰ ਡੁਬਾਨ ॥੧੭॥",
      "transliteration": "lajaa mara(n)t saagar ddubaan ||17||",
      "translation": "Seeing her hair, even Yamuna was filled with anger and seeing her serenity, the ocean felt shy.17.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਲਾਜ ਦੀ ਮਾਰੀ ਸਮੁੰਦਰ ਵਿਚ ਡੁਬ ਮਰੀ ॥੧੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "लजा मरंत सागर डुबान ॥१७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102004",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਾਹੂ ਬਿਲੋਕਿ ਲਾਜੈ ਮ੍ਰਿਨਾਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "baahoo bilok laajai miranaal ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਾਹਵਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਕਮਲ ਡੰਡੀਆਂ ਸ਼ਰਮਸਾਰ ਹੁੰਦੀਆਂ ਹਨ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बाहू बिलोकि लाजै मृनाल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102005",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0020",
      "lineIndex": 20,
      "gurmukhi": "ਖਿਸਿਯਾਨ ਹੰਸ ਅਵਿਲੋਕਿ ਚਾਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "khisiyaan ha(n)s avilok chaal ||",
      "translation": "Seeing her arms, the lotus-stalk felt she and the swans, seeing her gait got angry",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚਾਲ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਹੰਸ ਖਿਝਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "खिसियान हंस अविलोकि चाल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102006",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0021",
      "lineIndex": 21,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜੰਘਾ ਬਿਲੋਕਿ ਕਦਲੀ ਲਜਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ja(n)ghaa bilok kadhalee lajaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੰਘਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਕੇਲਾ ਸ਼ਰਮਾਉਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जंघा बिलोकि कदली लजान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102007",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0022",
      "lineIndex": 22,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਿਸ ਰਾਟ ਆਪ ਘਟਿ ਰੂਪ ਮਾਨ ॥੧੮॥",
      "transliteration": "nis raaT aap ghaT roop maan ||18||",
      "translation": "Seeing her legs, the Kadli trees became shyful and the moon considered his beauty inferior to her.18.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚੰਦ੍ਰਮਾ ('ਨਿਸਰਾਟ') ਆਪਣੇ ਰੂਪ ਨੂੰ (ਅਨਸੂਆ) ਤੋਂ ਘਟ ਮੰਨਦਾ ਹੈ ॥੧੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "निस राट आप घटि रूप मान ॥१८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102008",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0023",
      "lineIndex": 23,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਹ ਭਾਤਿ ਤਾਸੁ ਬਰਣੋ ਸਿੰਗਾਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eeh bhaat taas barano si(n)gaar ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਸ਼ਿੰਗਾਰ ਵਰਣਨ ਕਰਦਾ ਹਾ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इह भाति तासु बरणो सिंगार ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102009",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0024",
      "lineIndex": 24,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕੋ ਸਕੈ ਕਬਿ ਮਹਿਮਾ ਉਚਾਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ko sakai kab mahimaa uchaar ||",
      "translation": "In this way, the charm of her beauty is described, and no poet can utter her greatness",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੀ) ਮਹਿਮਾ ਨੂੰ ਕਿਹੜਾ ਕਵੀ ਕਹਿ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "को सकै कबि महिमा उचार ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102010",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0025",
      "lineIndex": 25,
      "gurmukhi": "ਐਸੀ ਸਰੂਪ ਅਵਿਲੋਕ ਅਤ੍ਰਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aaisee saroop avilok atr ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਜਿਹੇ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੀ ਨੂੰ ਅਤ੍ਰੀ ਮੁਨੀ ਨੇ ਵੇਖ ਲਿਆ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ऐसी सरूप अविलोक अतृ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102011",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਨੁ ਲੀਨ ਰੂਪ ਕੋ ਛੀਨ ਛਤ੍ਰ ॥੧੯॥",
      "transliteration": "jan leen roop ko chheen chhatr ||19||",
      "translation": "Seeing such a beauteous lady, the sage Atri believed that he had obtained canopied kingdom of beauty.19.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਜਿਸ ਨੇ) ਰੂਪ ਦੀ ਮਾਨੋ ਬਾਦਸ਼ਾਹੀ ਹੀ ਖੋਹ ਲਈ ਹੋਵੇ ॥੧੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जनु लीन रूप को छीन छत्र ॥१९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102012",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕੀਨੀ ਪ੍ਰਤਗਿ ਤਿਹ ਸਮੇ ਨਾਰਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "keenee pratag teh same naar ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਨੇ ਉਸ ਵੇਲੇ ਇਹ ਪ੍ਰਤਿਗਿਆ ਕਰ ਲਈ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कीनी प्रतगि तिह समे नारि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102013",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬ੍ਰਯਾਹੈ ਨ ਭੋਗ ਭੋਗੈ ਭਤਾਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "brayaahai na bhog bhogai bhataar ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਕਿ ਜੋ ਪਤੀ ਵਿਆਹ ਕੇ ਮੇਰੇ ਨਾਲ ਭੋਗ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰੇਗਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "ब्रयाहै न भोग भोगै भतार ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102014",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੈ ਬਰੌ ਤਾਸੁ ਰੁਚਿ ਮਾਨਿ ਚਿਤ ॥",
      "transliteration": "mai barau taas ruch maan chit ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮੈਂ ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਰੁਚੀ ਪੂਰਵਕ ਚਿਤ ਵਿਚ ਵਸਾ ਕੇ ਵਿਆਹ ਕਰਾਗੀ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मै बरौ तासु रुचि मानि चित ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102015",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜੋ ਸਹੈ ਕਸਟ ਐਸੇ ਪਵਿਤ ॥੨੦॥",
      "transliteration": "jo sahai kasaT aaise pavit ||20||",
      "translation": "That lady had vowed that she would not marry her husband for sexual enjoyment, and would wed that person, who would have the strength to endure the sacred tribulations of austrerities.20.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਜੋ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਦਾ ਪਵਿਤ੍ਰ ਕਸ਼ਟ ਸਹਿ ਸਕਦਾ ਹੋਵੇਗਾ ॥੨੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जो सहै कसट ऐसे पवित ॥२०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102016",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਿਖਿ ਮਾਨਿ ਬੈਨ ਤਬ ਬਰ੍ਰਯੋ ਵਾਹਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "rikh maan bain tab barrayo vaeh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਰਿਸ਼ੀ (ਅਤ੍ਰੀ) ਨੇ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਬਚਨ ਮੰਨ ਕੇ ਵਿਆਹ ਕਰ ਲਿਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रिखि मानि बैन तब बर्रयो वाहि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102017",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਨੁ ਲੀਨ ਲੂਟ ਸੀਗਾਰ ਤਾਹਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jan leen looT seegaar taeh ||",
      "translation": "The sage (Arti) had agreed with her vow and married her and sacrificed himself on her charm of beauty",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮਾਨੋ ਉਸ ਦਾ ਸ਼ਿੰਗਾਰ ਲੁਟ ਲਿਆ ਹੋਵੇ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जनु लीन लूट सीगार ताहि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102018",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਲੈ ਗਯੋ ਧਾਮਿ ਕਰਿ ਨਾਰਿ ਤਉਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "lai gayo dhaam kar naar taun ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਨੂੰ ਇਸਤਰੀ ਬਣਾ ਕੇ ਘਰ ਲੈ ਗਿਆ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "लै गयो धामि करि नारि तउन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102019",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪਿਤ ਦਤ ਦੇਵ ਮੁਨਿ ਅਤ੍ਰਿ ਜਉਨ ॥੨੧॥",
      "transliteration": "pit dhat dhev mun atr jaun ||21||",
      "translation": "He, the sage Atri, who was the father of Dattatreya, making her his wife, brought her home.21.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੋ ਦੱਤ ਦਾ ਪਿਤਾ ਅਤ੍ਰੀ ਮੁਨੀ ਸੀ ॥੨੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "पित दत देव मुनि अतृ जउन ॥२१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102020",
      "sourceShabadId": "9325",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਥ ਰੁਦ੍ਰ ਵਤਾਰ ਦਤ ਕਥਨੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "ath rudhr vataar dhat kathana(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੁਣ ਰੁਦ੍ਰ ਅਵਤਾਰ ਦੱਤ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अथ रुद्र वतार दत कथनं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102021",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤੋਮਰ ਛੰਦ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tomar chha(n)dh ||",
      "translation": "TOMAR STANZA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੋਮਰ ਛੰਦ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तोमर छंद ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102022",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁ ਬਰਖ ਬੀਤ ਕਿਨੋ ਬਿਵਾਹਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bahu barakh beet kino bivaeh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਵਿਆਹ ਕੀਤੇ ਬਹੁਤ ਸਾਲ ਗੁਜ਼ਰ ਗਏ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहु बरख बीत किनो बिवाहि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102023",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇਕ ਭਯੋ ਆਨਿ ਅਉਰੈ ਉਛਾਹਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "eik bhayo aan aaurai uchhaeh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਤਾ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੇ ਘਰ) ਇਕ ਹੋਰ ਉਤਸਾਹ ਵਰਧਕ (ਇਕੱਠ) ਹੋਇਆ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इक भयो आनि अउरै उछाहि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102024",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤਿਹ ਗਏ ਧਾਮਿ ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾਦਿ ਆਦਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "teh ge dhaam brahamaadh aadh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਘਰ ਆਦਿ ਦੇਵ ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਆਦਿ ਗਏ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तिह गए धामि ब्रहमादि आदि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102025",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿਨੀ ਸੁ ਸੇਵ ਤ੍ਰੀਯ ਬਹੁ ਪ੍ਰਸਾਦਿ ॥੨੨॥",
      "transliteration": "kinee su sev treey bahu prasaadh ||22||",
      "translation": "Several years passed after marriage and once an opportunity arose when Brahma and other gods went to the home of that sage the women of the hermitage of the sage performed great service to them.22.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਇਸਤਰੀ 'ਅਨਸੂਆ' ਨੇ ਉਨ੍ਰਹਾ ਦੀ ਬਹੁਤ ਰੁਚੀ ਨਾਲ ਸੇਵਾ ਕੀਤੀ ॥੨੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "किनी सु सेव त्रीय बहु प्रसादि ॥२२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102026",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਹੁ ਧੂਪ ਦੀਪ ਅਰੁ ਅਰਘ ਦਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bahu dhoop dheep ar aragh dhaan ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਬਹੁਤ ਧੂਪ-ਦੀਪ ਅਤੇ ਅਰਘ ਦਾਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बहु धूप दीप अरु अरघ दान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102027",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪਾਦਰਘਿ ਆਦਿ ਕਿਨੇ ਸੁਜਾਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "paadharagh aadh kine sujaan ||",
      "translation": "The incense was burnt, the lamps were lighted, there were libations and salutations",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਾਦ ਅਰਘ ਆਦਿ ਦੀ ਉਸ ਸਿਆਣੀ ਇਸਤਰੀ (ਨੇ ਸੇਵਾ ਕੀਤੀ)।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "पादरघि आदि किने सुजान ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102028",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਵਿਲੋਕਿ ਭਗਤਿ ਤਿਹ ਚਤੁਰ ਬਾਕ ॥",
      "transliteration": "avilok bhagat teh chatur baak ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਉਸ ਦੇ ਸਿਆਣੇ ਬੋਲਾ ਅਤੇ ਭਗਤੀ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अविलोकि भगति तिह चतुर बाक ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102029",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਇੰਦ੍ਰਾਦਿ ਬਿਸਨੁ ਬੈਠੇ ਪਿਨਾਕ ॥੨੩॥",
      "transliteration": "ei(n)dhraadh bisan baiThe pinaak ||23||",
      "translation": "Seeing Indra, Vishnu and Shiva, all the devotees eulogized them.23.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਸ਼ਿਵ ('ਪਿਨਾਕ') ਵਿਸ਼ਣੂ ਅਤੇ ਇੰਦਰ ਬੈਠੇ ਹੋਏ (ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ਹੋਏ) ॥੨੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "इंद्रादि बिसनु बैठे पिनाक ॥२३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102030",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਵਿਲੋਕਿ ਭਗਤਿ ਭਏ ਰਿਖ ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ॥",
      "transliteration": "avilok bhagat bhe rikh prasa(n)n ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਦੇ) ਭਗਤੀ ਵਾਲੇ ਸੁਭਾ ਨੂੰ ਵੇਖ ਕੇ ਰਿਸ਼ੀ ਵੀ ਬਹੁਤ ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ਹੋਇਆ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अविलोकि भगति भए रिख प्रसंन ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102031",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜੋ ਤਿਹੂ ਮਧਿ ਲੋਕਾਨਿ ਧਨਿ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jo tihoo madh lokaan dhan ||",
      "translation": "Seeing the devotion of the sage, all were pleased and all blessed him",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਜੋ ਤਿੰਨਾ ਲੋਕਾ ਵਿਚ ਧੰਨ ਮੰਨਿਆ ਜਾਦਾ ਹੈ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जो तिहू मधि लोकानि धनि ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102032",
      "sourceShabadId": "9326",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0636_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿਨੋ ਸੁ ਐਸ ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਉਚਾਰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "kino su aais brahamaa uchaar ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਉਸ ਵੇਲੇ ਪ੍ਰਸੰਨ ਹੋ ਕੇ) ਬ੍ਰਹਮਾ ਨੇ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕੀਤਾ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 636,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "किनो सु ऐस ब्रहमा उचार ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "102033",
